User Story: Improved Group Volume Controls
Task: Real-Time Checking for Group Volume Adjustments

Overview:
As a tester, I verified that group volume controls allowed seamless 
real-time adjustments for multiple devices in sync. Changes in volume were 
reflected immediately across all connected devices, with no noticeable 
lag or inconsistency. Testing confirmed smooth operation under various 
conditions, ensuring accurate and synchronized volume control without errors.
